 "remarks": "Tucked away in Westport's coveted Greens Farms neighborhood, this beautifully updated home is set on over 2 acres and offers the perfect balance of comfort, flexibility, and modern living. Beloved by its owners for many years, it has been the setting for countless family gatherings, celebrations, and cherished memories and is now ready for its next chapter. The renovated kitchen features an induction cooktop, abundant pantry space, and a bright eat-in area with sliders to a newly built deck, creating an effortless connection to the beautifully landscaped backyard. The adjoining family room, with its soaring cathedral ceiling and inviting fireplace, is the perfect place to gather. The spacious primary suite offers a renovated ensuite bath, while four additional bedrooms, including one ideal for a home office, provide ample space for family and guests. A renovated hall bath features a double vanity. A private wing with its own full kitchen and separate entrance provides flexibility for an in-law or au pair suite. The walk-out lower level adds a bedroom, full bath, and generous storage for guests, recreation, or extended living. Major improvements include the roof, replacement windows and doors, exterior repainting, high-efficiency furnace, hot water heater, and oil tank. Lovingly cared for and thoughtfully updated, this special home offers space, privacy, and versatility. Just minutes from schools, beaches, train, shopping, and all that Westport has to offer.",
